        {
          "id": "d8595477-87f7-3b93-8090-c35c67bfd0ba",
          "content": {
            "id": "d8595477-87f7-3b93-8090-c35c67bfd0ba",
            "contentType": "VIDEO",
            "title": "Google & Amazon join Trump admin's AI-powered 'Genesis mission'",
            "description": "<p>Yahoo Finance Senior Producer <a data-i13n=\"cpos:1;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/author/john-hyland/\">John Hyland</a> tracks Thursday's <a data-i13n=\"cpos:2;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/markets/stocks/trending/\">top moving stocks</a> and biggest market stories in this<a data-i13n=\"cpos:3;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/videos/series/market-minute/\"> Market Minute</a>.</p>\n<p>Amazon (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:4;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/AMZN\">AMZN</a>), Google (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:5;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/GOOG\">GOOG</a>, <a data-i13n=\"cpos:6;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/GOOGL\">GOOGL</a>), Nvidia (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:7;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/NVDA\">NVDA</a>), Palantir (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:8;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/PLTR\">PLTR</a>), and other companies are partnering with the Trump administration on its new \"Genesis mission.\"</p>\n<p>Lululemon (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:9;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/LULU\">LULU</a>) is facing activist investor pressure from Elliott Investment Management, which recently took a $1 billion stake in the retailer.</p>\n<p>Stay up to date on the latest market action, minute-by-minute, with <a data-i13n=\"cpos:10;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/videos/series/market-minute/\">Yahoo Finance's Market Minute.</a></p>",
            "summary": "Yahoo Finance Senior Producer John Hyland tracks Thursday's top moving stocks and biggest market stories in this Market Minute. Amazon (AMZN), Google (GOOG, GOOGL), Nvidia (NVDA), Palantir (PLTR), and other companies are partnering with the Trump administration on its new \"Genesis mission.\" Lululemon (LULU) is facing activist investor pressure from Elliott Investment Management, which recently took a $1 billion stake in the retailer. Stay up to date on the latest market action, minute-by-minute, with Yahoo Finance's Market Minute.",
